  - "D\xF9 ai \u0111i xa t\u1EDBi \u0111\xE2u, ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n nh\u1EDB m\xE0u l\xFAa v\xE0ng v\xE0 b\xF3ng nh\xE0 s\xE0n n\xE0y l\xE0 nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\u1EC1 qu\xEA h\u01B0\u01A1ng."
